            "[{'generated_text': 'what is llm in ai?\\n\\nLLM stands for Large Language Model. It is a type of artificial intelligence (AI) that is designed to understand and generate human-like natural language. LLMs are trained on vast amounts of text data and can perform a wide range of language-related tasks, such as text generation, translation, summarization, question answering, and more.\\n\\nLLMs are based on sophisticated algorithms and neural networks that enable them to process and analyze large volumes of text data. They are capable of understanding the context and meaning of the text they are given, as well as generating coherent and contextually appropriate responses.\\n\\nOne of the most popular LLMs is GPT-3 (Generative Pre-trained Transformer 3), developed by OpenAI. GPT-3 is a large language model trained on a massive dataset and can be used for a variety of tasks, including natural language processing, machine translation, and sentiment analysis. LLMs have been highly effective in various industries, such as customer service, e-commerce, and language translation, due to their ability to generate high-quality text responses to queries.'}]\n"
